id: SCA-050
title: Dockerfile COPY from untrusted image
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Dockerfile
  extensions: .dockerfile
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: COPY --from
patterns:
  - regex: COPY\s+--from=[a-zA-Z]
    message: COPY --from references named external image. If the image is compromised or unversioned, malicious files enter the build. Numbered stages (--from=0) are safer.
fix: Use numbered build stages (--from=0) or named stages defined in this Dockerfile. For external images, pin by digest — image@sha256:...
